{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"nl -ba src/cljs/datomworld/demo/compilation_pipeline_v2.cljs | sed -n '1,120p;300,490p'; rg -n '\"'^'\"\\\\(def|Python|PHP|Clojure|language|highlight|Step|Pause|Resume|Run|Reset' src/cljs/datomworld/demo/compilation_pipeline.cljs\"","aggregated_output":"     1\t(ns datomworld.demo.compilation-pipeline-v2\n     2\t  \"The Yin compilation pipeline on Yin VM v2: Source -> AST -> canonical\n     3\t   datoms -> ast-walker execution.\n     4\t\n     5\t   The v1 demo (`datomworld.demo.compilation-pipeline`) compiled the same\n     6\t   source through four evaluators — stack, register, semantic and ast-walker —\n     7\t   and showed each one's bytecode beside the shared datom store, with a\n     8\t   `dao.space` query panel over the transacted datoms.\n     9\t\n    10\t   `yin.vm` ships one evaluator. The divergence register states it\n    11\t   directly: `semantic`, `register`, `stack`, `space`, `macro` and `wasm` are\n    12\t   not ported, and user macros throw. So this pipeline has one compilation\n    13\t   path and one execution path:\n    14\t\n    15\t   - **Source -> AST** is unchanged: `yang.clojure/compile-program`.\n    16\t   - **AST -> canonical datoms** is unchanged: `vm/ast->datoms` is shared\n    17\t     kernel, reused by v2 rather than forked.\n    18\t   - **Execution** is `yin.vm.ast-walker`, constructed with a\n    19\t     composition-supplied `:make-stream` over the DaoStream v2 ring buffer.\n    20\t     There is no bytecode, no assembler, no pool and no source map to show.\n    21\t   - Programs are loaded with `ast-walker/vm-load-program`, the loader host\n    22\t     composition hands to observer coordination. The demo calls it directly\n    23\t     because it animates one `vm/step` at a time; the VM owns no program\n    24\t     medium of its own and accepts no `:in-stream`.\n    25\t\n    26\t   What the v1 demo showed that this one cannot: register and stack\n    27\t   instruction listings with active-instruction highlighting, the semantic\n    28\t   evaluator's AST database, and `dao.space` queries over the transacted\n    29\t   datoms. Those are v1 evaluator features, not v2 gaps in a demo.\"\n    30\t  (:require [\"@codemirror/state\" :refer [EditorState]]\n    31\t            [\"@codemirror/theme-one-dark\" :refer [oneDark]]\n    32\t            [\"@codemirror/view\" :refer [EditorView]]\n    33\t            [\"@nextjournal/lang-clojure\" :refer [clojure]]\n    34\t            [\"codemirror\" :refer [basicSetup]]\n    35\t            [cljs.reader :as reader]\n    36\t            [clojure.string :as str]\n    37\t            [dao.stream.ringbuffer :as ringbuffer]\n    38\t            [datomworld.demo.responsive :as responsive]\n    39\t            [reagent.core :as r]\n    40\t            [yang.clojure :as yang]\n    41\t            [yin.demo.utils :as demo.utils]\n    42\t            [yin.vm :as vm]\n    43\t            [yin.vm.ast-walker :as ast-walker]\n    44\t            [yin.vm.module :as module]))\n    45\t\n    46\t\n    47\t(def ^:private pretty-print demo.utils/pretty-print)\n    48\t\n    49\t\n    50\t(def default-source\n    51\t  \"(defn fact [n acc]\n    52\t  (if (= n 0)\n    53\t    acc\n    54\t    (fact (- n 1) (* n acc))))\n    55\t\n    56\t(fact 10 1)\")\n    57\t\n    58\t\n    59\t;; =============================================================================\n    60\t;; The composition\n    61\t;; =============================================================================\n    62\t\n    63\t(defn- make-stream\n    64\t  \"The `:make-stream` this composition hands the VM: one DaoStream v2 ring\n    65\t   buffer per call. A nil capacity is the VM's default, not an unbounded\n    66\t   stream; v2 has no unbounded mode.\"\n    67\t  [capacity]\n    68\t  (ringbuffer/create!\n    69\t    {:dao.stream/type ringbuffer/transport-type,\n    70\t     ringbuffer/capacity-key (or capacity vm/default-stream-capacity)}))\n    71\t\n    72\t\n    73\t(defn- make-vm\n    74\t  []\n    75\t  (ast-walker/create-vm\n    76\t    {:primitives vm/primitives,\n    77\t     :modules (module/register-stream-module (module/default-registry)),\n    78\t     :make-stream make-stream}))\n    79\t\n    80\t\n    81\t(defn- load-program!\n    82\t  \"Load one canonical datom batch onto a fresh VM.\"\n    83\t  [datoms]\n    84\t  (ast-walker/vm-load-program (make-vm) (vec datoms)))\n    85\t\n    86\t\n    87\t(defonce app-state\n    88\t  (r/atom {:source default-source,\n    89\t           :ast nil,\n    90\t           :datom-groups nil,\n    91\t           :datoms nil,\n    92\t           :walker nil,\n    93\t           :walker-running false,\n    94\t           :walker-result nil,\n    95\t           :steps 0,\n    96\t           :error nil}))\n    97\t\n    98\t\n    99\t(defonce run-raf-id (atom nil))\n   100\t\n   101\t\n   102\t(defn stop-run-loop!\n   103\t  []\n   104\t  (when @run-raf-id\n   105\t    (js/cancelAnimationFrame @run-raf-id)\n   106\t    (reset! run-raf-id nil))\n   107\t  (swap! app-state assoc :walker-running false))\n   108\t\n   109\t\n   110\t(defn set-source!\n   111\t  [next-source]\n   112\t  (stop-run-loop!)\n   113\t  (swap! app-state assoc\n   114\t         :source next-source\n   115\t         :ast nil\n   116\t         :datom-groups nil\n   117\t         :datoms nil\n   118\t         :walker nil\n   119\t         :walker-result nil\n   120\t         :steps 0\n   300\t    [:strong {:style {:color \"#f1f5ff\", :font-size \"13px\"}} title]\n   301\t    [:span {:style {:color \"#8b949e\", :font-size \"11px\"}} subtitle]]\n   302\t   [:div\n   303\t    {:style {:padding \"10px\",\n   304\t             :display \"flex\",\n   305\t             :flex-direction \"column\",\n   306\t             :gap \"8px\",\n   307\t             :flex \"1\",\n   308\t             :min-height \"0\"}} body]])\n   309\t\n   310\t\n   311\t(defn- walker-cesk\n   312\t  [vm-state]\n   313\t  (when vm-state\n   314\t    (let [continuation (vm/continuation vm-state)]\n   315\t      {:control (let [c (vm/control vm-state)]\n   316\t                  (or (:type c) (when (some? c) :program-root))),\n   317\t       :environment (:env vm-state),\n   318\t       :store (:store vm-state),\n   319\t       :continuation {:depth (count (or continuation [])),\n   320\t                      :frames (->> (or continuation [])\n   321\t                                   (take 12)\n   322\t                                   (mapv (fn [frame]\n   323\t                                           {:type (:type frame),\n   324\t                                            :node-type (get-in frame\n   325\t                                                               [:frame\n   326\t                                                                :type])})))},\n   327\t       :parked (count (or (:parked vm-state) {})),\n   328\t       :ready-queue-count (count (or (:ready-queue vm-state) [])),\n   329\t       :wait-set-count (count (or (:wait-set vm-state) [])),\n   330\t       :halted? (:halted? vm-state),\n   331\t       :blocked? (:blocked? vm-state),\n   332\t       :value (:value vm-state)})))\n   333\t\n   334\t\n   335\t(defn- datom-listing\n   336\t  [datoms]\n   337\t  (str/join \"\\n\"\n   338\t            (map-indexed (fn [i d] (str i \": \" (pr-str d))) datoms)))\n   339\t\n   340\t\n   341\t(defn- ast-text\n   342\t  [ast]\n   343\t  (if ast (pretty-print ast) \"Compile source to view the AST.\"))\n   344\t\n   345\t\n   346\t(defn main-view\n   347\t  []\n   348\t  (r/create-class\n   349\t    {:display-name \"compilation-pipeline-v2-main\",\n   350\t     :component-did-mount\n   351\t     (fn []\n   352\t       (when-not (:datoms @app-state) (compile-source!))),\n   353\t     :component-will-unmount (fn [] (stop-run-loop!)),\n   354\t     :reagent-render\n   355\t     (fn []\n   356\t       (let [{:keys [source ast datoms walker walker-running walker-result\n   357\t                     steps error]}\n   358\t             @app-state\n   359\t             cesk (walker-cesk walker)\n   360\t             halted? (when walker (vm/halted? walker))]\n   361\t         [:div\n   362\t          {:style {:min-height \"100vh\",\n   363\t                   :background \"#060817\",\n   364\t                   :color \"#c5c6c7\",\n   365\t                   :padding \"96px 16px 24px\",\n   366\t                   :display \"flex\",\n   367\t                   :flex-direction \"column\",\n   368\t                   :gap \"12px\",\n   369\t                   :box-sizing \"border-box\"}}\n   370\t          [:div\n   371\t           {:style {:display \"flex\",\n   372\t                    :justify-content \"space-between\",\n   373\t                    :align-items \"center\",\n   374\t                    :gap \"12px\",\n   375\t                    :flex-wrap \"wrap\"}}\n   376\t           [:h1 {:style {:margin 0, :font-size \"1.4rem\", :color \"#f1f5ff\"}}\n   377\t            \"Yin VM v2 Compilation Pipeline\"]\n   378\t           [:div\n   379\t            {:style {:display \"flex\",\n   380\t                     :gap \"8px\",\n   381\t                     :align-items \"center\",\n   382\t                     :flex-wrap \"wrap\"}}\n   383\t            [:button\n   384\t             {:on-click compile-source!,\n   385\t              :style {:background \"#1f6feb\",\n   386\t                      :color \"#fff\",\n   387\t                      :border \"none\",\n   388\t                      :padding \"8px 12px\",\n   389\t                      :border-radius \"5px\",\n   390\t                      :cursor \"pointer\",\n   391\t                      :font-size \"12px\"}} \"Compile\"]\n   392\t            [:button\n   393\t             {:on-click reset-walker!,\n   394\t              :disabled (not (seq datoms)),\n   395\t              :style {:background (if (seq datoms) \"#6e7681\" \"#333\"),\n   396\t                      :color \"#fff\",\n   397\t                      :border \"none\",\n   398\t                      :padding \"8px 12px\",\n   399\t                      :border-radius \"5px\",\n   400\t                      :cursor (if (seq datoms) \"pointer\" \"not-allowed\"),\n   401\t                      :font-size \"12px\"}} \"Reset\"]\n   402\t            [:button\n   403\t             {:on-click step-walker!,\n   404\t              :disabled (or (not (seq datoms)) halted?),\n   405\t              :style {:background (if (and (seq datoms) (not halted?))\n   406\t                                    \"#238636\"\n   407\t                                    \"#333\"),\n   408\t                      :color \"#fff\",\n   409\t                      :border \"none\",\n   410\t                      :padding \"8px 12px\",\n   411\t                      :border-radius \"5px\",\n   412\t                      :cursor (if (and (seq datoms) (not halted?))\n   413\t                                \"pointer\"\n   414\t                                \"not-allowed\"),\n   415\t                      :font-size \"12px\"}} \"Step\"]\n   416\t            [:button\n   417\t             {:on-click toggle-run!,\n   418\t              :disabled (or (not (seq datoms)) halted?),\n   419\t              :style {:background (cond (not (seq datoms)) \"#333\"\n   420\t                                        halted? \"#333\"\n   421\t                                        walker-running \"#da3633\"\n   422\t                                        :else \"#238636\"),\n   423\t                      :color \"#fff\",\n   424\t                      :border \"none\",\n   425\t                      :padding \"8px 12px\",\n   426\t                      :border-radius \"5px\",\n   427\t                      :cursor (if (and (seq datoms) (not halted?))\n   428\t                                \"pointer\"\n   429\t                                \"not-allowed\"),\n   430\t                      :font-size \"12px\"}}\n   431\t             (if walker-running \"Pause\" \"Run\")]\n   432\t            [:span {:style {:color \"#8b949e\", :font-size \"12px\"}}\n   433\t             (str steps \" steps\")]]]\n   434\t          [:div\n   435\t           {:style {:display \"grid\",\n   436\t                    :grid-template-columns (responsive/auto-fit-grid 320),\n   437\t                    :gap \"12px\",\n   438\t                    :flex \"1\",\n   439\t                    :min-height \"0\"}}\n   440\t           [:div {:style {:min-height (responsive/fluid-height 280 42 380)}}\n   441\t            [card \"Source\" \"CodeMirror editor: Clojure code\"\n   442\t             [codemirror-editor\n   443\t              {:value source,\n   444\t               :on-change set-source!,\n   445\t               :style {:height \"100%\"}}]]]\n   446\t           [:div {:style {:min-height (responsive/fluid-height 280 42 380)}}\n   447\t            [card \"AST\"\n   448\t             \"yang.clojure/compile-program\"\n   449\t             [codemirror-editor\n   450\t              {:value (ast-text ast),\n   451\t               :read-only true,\n   452\t               :style {:height \"100%\"}}]]]\n   453\t           [:div {:style {:min-height (responsive/fluid-height 280 42 380)}}\n   454\t            [card (str \"Canonical Datoms\" (when datoms\n   455\t                                            (str \" (\" (count datoms) \")\")))\n   456\t             \"vm/ast->datoms — the v2 program representation\"\n   457\t             [codemirror-editor\n   458\t              {:value (if (seq datoms)\n   459\t                        (datom-listing datoms)\n   460\t                        \"Compile source to view the canonical datoms.\"),\n   461\t               :read-only true,\n   462\t               :style {:height \"100%\"}}]]]\n   463\t           [:div {:style {:min-height (responsive/fluid-height 320 50 460)}}\n   464\t            [card \"ASTWalker VM (v2)\"\n   465\t             \"CESK state, one vm/step at a time\"\n   466\t             [codemirror-editor\n   467\t              {:value (or (some-> cesk pretty-print)\n   468\t                          \"Compile source to construct the VM.\"),\n   469\t               :read-only true,\n   470\t               :style {:height \"100%\"}}]]]\n   471\t           [:div {:style {:min-height (responsive/fluid-height 240 34 320)}}\n   472\t            [card \"Result\"\n   473\t             \"The value the evaluator computed\"\n   474\t             [codemirror-editor\n   475\t              {:value (cond walker-result (pr-str walker-result)\n   476\t                            halted? (str \"Halted: \" (pr-str (vm/value walker)))\n   477\t                            :else \"Step or Run to compute a value.\"),\n   478\t               :read-only true,\n   479\t               :style {:height \"100%\"}}]]]]\n   480\t          (when error\n   481\t            [:div\n   482\t             {:style {:background \"rgba(255,0,0,0.2)\",\n   483\t                      :border \"1px solid #da3633\",\n   484\t                      :padding \"8px\",\n   485\t                      :font-size \"12px\",\n   486\t                      :color \"#f85149\"}} error])]))}))\n29:(def ^:private pretty-print demo.utils/pretty-print)\n32:(def highlight-decoration (.mark Decoration #js {:class \"cm-highlight-node\"}))\n35:(def set-highlight (.define StateEffect))\n38:(def highlight-field\n44:                                      (if (.is effect set-highlight)\n51:                                                           highlight-decoration\n62:(def card-order [:source :walker :semantic :register :stack :query])\n65:(def layout-style-options\n69:(def layout-pairs\n75:(defn- clamp\n84:(defn- rounded\n89:(defn- compact-layout\n130:(defn- card-size-profile\n152:(defn- style-anchors\n170:(defn- overlap-deltas\n186:(defn- normalize-layout-bounds\n197:(defn- separate-overlap\n226:(defn- resolve-overlaps\n239:(defn responsive-layout\n267:(def default-positions\n277:(def default-vm-pane-ratios\n284:(defonce app-state\n349:(defn show-explainer-video!\n354:(defn- normalize-pane-ratios\n365:(defn- clamp-pane-ratios\n375:(defn- resize-pane-ratios\n388:(defn- start-panel-resize!\n410:(defn- relayout-ui!\n438:(defn codemirror-editor\n439:  [{:keys [value on-change read-only language highlight-range]}]\n447:           (let [lang-ext (case language\n456:                              highlight-field]\n470:             (when highlight-range\n472:                          #js {:effects #js [(.of set-highlight\n473:                                                  highlight-range)]}))\n477:         (let [{:keys [value highlight-range]} (r/props this)\n478:               old-highlight-range (:highlight-range (second old-argv))]\n487:             (when (not= highlight-range old-highlight-range)\n488:               (let [effects #js [(.of set-highlight highlight-range)]\n489:                     effects (if (and highlight-range\n490:                                      (not= highlight-range\n491:                                            old-highlight-range))\n495:                                               (first highlight-range))])\n511:(defn add-yin-ids\n520:(defn ast->pretty-text\n525:(defn read-ast-forms\n531:(defn set-vm-state!\n537:(defn clear-vm-state!\n542:(defn- queue-vm-state\n555:(defn load-stack-state\n560:(defn load-register-state\n565:(defn load-semantic-state\n570:(defn load-walker-state\n575:(defn compile-stack\n616:(defn reset-stack\n617:  \"Reset stack VM to initial state from canonical datom program.\"\n627:(def steps-per-frame 100)\n630:(defn step-vm\n643:                    (str (name vm-key) \" VM Step Error: \" (.-message e)))\n647:(defn run-vm-loop\n672:(defn toggle-run-vm\n680:(defn reset-walker\n681:  \"Reset AST Walker VM to initial state.\"\n693:           (.error js/console \"AST Walker Reset Error:\" e)\n696:                  (str \"AST Walker Reset Error: \" (.-message e)))))))\n699:(defn compile-ast\n747:(defn reset-semantic\n748:  \"Reset semantic VM to initial state.\"\n759:(defn- parse-in-bindings\n773:(defn run-query\n796:(defn compile-register\n840:(defn reset-register\n841:  \"Reset register VM to initial state from canonical datom program.\"\n854:(defn compile-source\n880:(def code-examples\n881:  [{:name \"Clojure: Basic Math\", :lang :clojure, :code \"(+ 10 20)\"}\n882:   {:name \"Clojure: Closure Power\",\n886:   {:name \"Clojure: Factorial\",\n890:   {:name \"Clojure: Fibonacci\",\n894:   {:name \"Python: Basic Math\", :lang :python, :code \"10 + 20\"}\n895:   {:name \"Python: Closure Power\",\n899:   {:name \"Python: Factorial\",\n903:   {:name \"Python: Fibonacci\",\n907:   {:name \"PHP: Basic Math\", :lang :php, :code \"10 + 20;\"}\n908:   {:name \"PHP: Closure Power\",\n912:   {:name \"PHP: Factorial\",\n916:   {:name \"PHP: Fibonacci\",\n922:(defn dropdown-menu\n965:(defn hamburger-menu\n972:(def query-examples\n1012:(defn query-menu\n1018:(defn layout-controls\n1047:(defn vm-control-buttons\n1048:  \"Render Step/Run/Reset buttons for a VM.\"\n1069:        :font-size \"12px\"}} \"Step\"]\n1081:               :font-size \"12px\"}} (if running \"Pause\" \"Run\")]\n1091:               :font-size \"12px\"}} \"Reset\"]]))\n1094:(defn vm-state-display\n1134:(defn vm-result-editor\n1152:(defn vm-divider\n1163:(defn vm-split-layout\n1184:(defn bring-to-front!\n1191:(defn draggable-card\n1277:(defn connection-line\n1340:(defn handle-mouse-move\n1372:(defn handle-mouse-up\n1380:(defonce resize-raf-id (atom nil))\n1383:(defn handle-window-resize\n1391:(defn datom-list-view\n1414:(defn instruction-list-view\n1438:(defn- active-reg-idx\n1446:(defn- active-stack-idx\n1454:(defn main-view\n1551:              [:option {:value \"clojure\"} \"Clojure\"]\n1552:              [:option {:value \"python\"} \"Python\"]\n1553:              [:option {:value \"php\"} \"PHP\"]] [hamburger-menu app-state]]\n1557:              :language (:source-