{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"agent_message","text":"The Flutter widget explicitly requests `:semantic`, so changing only the REPL’s default would make widget startup throw. I also found a real gap in the pipeline twin: v1 offers Python and PHP input, while v2 only accepts Clojure. The plan needs to distinguish intentional VM feature removals from features it promises to preserve.\n"}}
